Notable direct dependencies (not vendored; each ships under its own
license from its own package):

- @noble/curves, @noble/ciphers, @noble/hashes (MIT, Paul Miller) —
  the audited cryptographic primitives under `@mosadd/crypto`.
- zod (MIT) — schema validation in `@mosadd/protocol` and `@mosadd/mcp`.
- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk (MIT, Anthropic) — MCP server runtime
  in `@mosadd/mcp`.
- @supabase/supabase-js (MIT) — backend client in `@mosadd/mcp`.

For a machine-readable manifest of every dependency and its license,
generate one locally with `pnpm licenses list --json` from the repo root.
